{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團防彈少年團（BTS）成員V最近為國際奢侈品牌亮相時尚雜誌，此次寫真在美國比華利山莊的豪宅取景，採訪隊於8月專程飛往洛杉磯，在BTS巡唱期間為其拍攝。</p><p>本期共推出6款不同風格的封面，除了有貴公子Look，V還以半裸上陣，前額秀髮微微沾濕</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.234990+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T02:42:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"90d8157c79442fa59f383ec28d41ad8f580fa3274dbbbc2cf7c75cc06c548cff","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}